Apple-200688447.description:
Imagine what you could do here. At Apple, new insights have a way of becoming extraordinary products, services, and customer experiences very quickly. Bring passion and dedication to your job; there's no telling what you could accomplish. 

At Apple, we don’t just build products — we create the wonder that’s revolutionized entire industries. It’s the diversity of our people and their ideas that support the innovation that runs through everything we do, from amazing technology to industry-leading environmental efforts. Join Apple, and help us leave the world better than we found it. 

In the NPI OPM team, you are the primary operations interface to the core engineering product development teams and other multi-functional organizations within Apple and the external contract manufacturers. You will support the new product ramp to deliver products in the fastest time with the highest product quality to the market. 

Assist with new product introduction, from initial design validation to mass production phase;

Work with global NPI team to drive ramp readiness with engineering, operations, and contract manufacturers, focus on overall capacity planning, manufacturing process scalability and overall bring up plan of multiple factory sites that includes factory space, labor hiring, training, and production lines qualifications

Support Engineering and global NPI team implementing design development builds in Asia;

Coordinate all operations-related communications through the organization, escalate key issues, and present solutions and risk mitigations to multi-functional executive teams;

Drive Engineering, Operations, and Contract Manufacturers on design for manufacturing to enable continued volume growth at the best product quality

Support critical mechanical tooling fixture validation builds when the design is mature, from the last phase of design development through initial mass production

Apple-200688447.requirements:
Minimum qualifications / 最低资格
Bachelor's degree or equivalent experience. Master/MBA is preferred;

Strong communications skills and fluent English, command good executive presence.

Preferred qualifications / 优先条件
Academic background or experience in Mechanical, EE, Automation, Wireless Engineering, or Industrial Engineering. 

Experience in manufacturing, process engineering, or product development;

Experience with Data Analysis or Natural language processing would be a plus 

Results-oriented and attention to detail, highly upbeat, proactive, hands-on, and organized;

Work in a highly dynamic, fast-paced, and ambiguous environment;

Ability to facilitate difficult issues and drive multi-functional teams for closures.

